r previous exploration experience cannot help you or provide a sense of security. The randomly occurring horror phenomena and monsters add to the fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must identify all abnormalities and find a way to eliminate them, ensuring that they do not overlook anything in order to safely reach the end. Otherwise, they will be continuously killed and reborn by an indescribable unknown evil force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the gameplay of horror suspense and light roguelike elements, the game features a certain level of narrative and character development. The dark, eerie atmosphere of the subway is filled with the unknown and mysteries. Players explore and interact with various characters, monsters, and anomalies to gain an immersive role-playing experience and narrative insights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will showcase refreshing monster designs and bizarre horror imagery, aiming to create a strong psychological horror atmosphere and incomprehensible terrifying scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the continuous arrival of the unknown and surprises, do you dare to challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263210/extras/815af7850a7384a256a861090b164d16.avif?t=1739206955\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263210/extras_big/815af7850a7384a256a861090b164d16.avif?t=1739206955 width=800 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u7ea4\u6307\u6e38\u620f"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RP